# Demo wallets — generated Testnet keypairs, secret keys included. Worthless by
# construction, and still not something to commit.
web/scripts/demo/.wallets.json

# The demo-video pipeline, in full: the Remotion project that composites the
# walkthrough, and the Playwright harness that records it. Kept out of the
# repository deliberately — it is production tooling for one deliverable
# (a video that ships as a link), not part of the app, and its captures are
# hundreds of megabytes of regenerable screen recording.
video/
web/scripts/record/
web/scripts/demo/make-signer.mjs

# The demo workspace itself: the SQL that stages one recording session and
# carries the seeded cast verbatim, and the script that mints its keypairs.
